<div><span class="c4">ADDITIONAL TERMS: - </span></div>
<div>&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">34</span><span class="c6i"></span><span class="c4">NOT TO ALTER NAME:</span>&#160; The Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) or the Association of the Owners of the Apartments shall not alter or subscribe to the alteration of the name of <span class="c4">"ANANDA THE DRIZZLE"</span> in Schedule-A Property and/or alter the names assigned to the Blocks therein. The Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) acknowledges, agree and understand that the name <span class="c4">"ANANDA THE DRIZZLE"</span> is final for the Schedule A Property.</div>
<div class="c46">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">35</span><span class="c6i"></span>That in the event of VENDEE(S) herein avails/availed a loan facility from any bank/financial institution for the purchase of the subject Flat, the VENDEE(S) hereby assures, declares and undertakes to not to sell, convey, alienate or transfer his title, ownership, mortgage, lease, transfer, interest, possession rights and privileges etc., in/upon the schedule B(1) property to any other person at any point of time between the date of this Sale Agreement and Sale Deed Registration for any reason. However, in the absence of loan from bank/financial institution on the subject Flat, the VENDEE(S) is at liberty to sell or transfer his title, ownership, possession rights etc., by any conveyance deed/s in favor of anyone of his choice.</div>
<div class="c46">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">36</span><span class="c6i"></span>That the <span class="c4">Vendors/Developers/Promoters</span> shall share soft copy of all Link Documents and other Relevant Documents if any, in respect of the Schedule A Property to the VENDEE(S).</div>
<div>&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">37</span><span class="c6i"></span>ASSIGNMENT: The Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) shall not assign/transfer his/her/their Interest under this Agreement without the prior written consent of the <span class="c4">Vendors/Developers/Promoters</span> herein. It is explicitly made clear that the <span class="c4">Vendors/Developers/Promoters</span> herein is not obligated to give its consent for any assignment/transfer by the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) as this contract is exclusive in nature. The <span class="c4">Vendors/Developers/Promoters</span> herein is not obligated to give its consent for any assignment/transfer till their primary sale of all Apartments is fully completed.</div>
<div class="c46">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">38</span><span class="c6i"></span>It is also agreed that, in the event the Vendors/Developers/Promoters herein gives its consent for assignment/transfer of Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s)'s/s' Interest in this Agreement, the Assignee/s shall comply with all the terms and conditions which the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) is/are required to comply and pay the total sale consideration under this agreement and further the Vendors/ Developers/ Promoters herein shall be entitled to collect the administrative charges and transfer fee for giving such consent, the said charges per Sq. Feet of the Schedule - B(1) Property is upon the sole disceration of the Vendors/ Developers/ Promoters.</div>
<div style="page-break-after:always;height:0"></div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">39</span><span class="c6i"></span>It is also made clear that the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) will not be able to assign. his/her/their rights in parts/portions i.e., the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) will have to either assign all his/her/their rights under this Agreement or otherwise shall not be entitled to assign his/her/their rights at all. In the event of the <span class="c4">Vendors/Developers/Promoters</span> herein granting such permission, the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) and his assignee/nominee ensure to execute the required documentation at their cost as advised by the <span class="c4">Vendors/Developers/Promoters</span> herein and pay the necessary taxes, duties that are associated with such transfer.</div>
<div>&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">40</span><span class="c6i"></span>It is further agreed that while executing and carrying out wood works, interior works within the residential flat at the cost of the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s), if any damage is caused to the works already executed by the Developers/Promoters either inside the Flat or in the common areas of the Complex, the Allottees/Purchasers shall be liable to pay such amount to the Developers/Promoters which will be equivalent to the damage caused by the Allottees/Purchasers. In the event of the Allottees/Purchasers leave the dust and wastage un-removed at the time of interior works carried out by the Allottees/Purchasers, the Developers/Promoters will get the same removed and in such an event, the Allottees/Purchasers shall pay the required labour charges as demanded by the Developers/Promoters. Further the Allottees/Purchasers hereby agrees and undertakes to pay the power charges for electricity consumed at the time of interior works carried out by the Allottees/Purchaser for utilization of electricity.</div>
<div class="c46">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">41</span><span class="c6i"></span>The DEVELOPERS/PROMOTERS herein reserves the right to retain/remove/plant any trees/plants, electrical equipment, equipment, road structures/driveways, garbage bins etc., in the Schedule - A property till the completion of the project. The ALLOTTEE(S)/PURCHASER(S) has/have expressly given consent for variations and/or modifications as the Architect/ DEVELOPERS/PROMOTERS herein may consider necessary from time to time during the course of construction and during the period which the DEVELOPERS/PROMOTERS herein undertakes the administration of maintenance of common areas, amenities and facilities subject to the required permissions from the authorities, subject to the condition that there will not be any material change in the apartment shown to the ALLOTTEES/PURCHASERS basing on which the decision of purchase has been made. The Architect and DEVELOPERS/PROMOTERS herein is the final decision makers on these aspects and the ALLOTTEE(S)/PURCHASER(S) shall not interfere or question the design, construction processes etc., implemented by the DEVELOPERS/PROMOTERS herein.</div>
<div class="c77">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">42</span><span class="c6i"></span>The Vendors/Promoters/Developers herein has the right to instruct the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) to remit the installments payable under this Agreement with standing instructions to the bank accounts of the Vendors/Promoters/Developers herein which may be in the nature of Current Accounts/Over Draft Accounts/Loans Accounts/Escrow Accounts as the case may be and the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) agrees to confirm such compliance in writing in the m&#228;nner as may be required to the Vendors/Promoters/Developers herein or their Bankers from time to time.</div>
<div style="page-break-after:always;height:0"></div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">43</span><span class="c6i"></span>The timing and the mode of execution of the Sale Deed under the applicable laws in favor of the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) would be on receipt of the total consideration, taxes and other amounts as applicable, from the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) and would be in the manner the Vendors/Promoters/Developers herein advises the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s).</div>
<div class="cc">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">44</span><span class="c6i"></span>Defects arising from natural wear and tear and any defect resulting on account of negligent acts of the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) or Act of God do not fall under the scope of maintenance under defect liability. In case of disputes as to quantity or quality in the construction of Schedule B (1) Property, the decision of the Architect of the project is final and binding.</div>
<div class="cc">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">45</span><span class="c6i"></span>The Vendors/Promoters/Developers herein has decided to float a Corpus Fund for the entire High-Rise Multi-Storied Residential Apartment Complex which is payable by the ultimate Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s)s, Land Owners/their successors of the residential apartments/flats, as the case may be, Including the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) herein at the time of delivery of the possession of the Residential apartments/flats and such Corpus Fund is specified above The Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) herein hereby agrees and undertakes to pay the said amount of Corpus Fund to the Vendors/Promoters/Developers herein at the time of execution and registration of Sale Deed in his/her/their favour In respect of the Schedule B(1) Property. Such fund will be governed and held initially by the Vendors/Promoters/Developers herein as a custodian and after the construction of Complex is completed in all respects, the said Corpus Fund will be transferred, handed over and made over to the Association or Society formed among the owners of the apartments/flats in the complex after its formation simultaneously along with the handing over of the administration, common areas and amenities to the association.</div>
<div class="c46">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">46</span><span class="c6i"></span>The Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) shall pay to the Vendors/Promoters/Developers herein the initial two years of maintenance charges. If any point of time, during the period of above two years, if such payment made towards common area maintenance charges are not sufficient to meet the expenditure to be incurred, the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) herein and all other Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) shall pay such additional sums from time to time as per the demand made by the Vendors/Promoters/Developers herein without raising any objection of whatsoever nature.</div>
<div class="c3m">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">47</span><span class="c6i"></span>That the Vendor/Developer hereby declares that the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) herein accepts and undertakes to get/make things by himself/herself i.e., like kitchen slab/platform, shink, tiles, exhaust unit/fans, kitchen modular units and other related things as per his/her taste and the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) hereby confirms to bear the total cost of the same.</div>
<div style="page-break-after:always;height:0"></div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">48</span><span class="c6i"></span>After the expiry of the initial period of two years, the Vendors/Promoters/ Developers herein agrees to transfer the administration of maintenance of the common areas of the Complex to the Owners Association. However, upon expiry of the said initial period of two years, the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) herein and all other owners/occupants of the apartments/flats in the project shall regularly pay proportionate monthly maintenance charges to the Owners Association.</div>
<div class="c46">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">49</span><span class="c6i"></span>The facilities of the Club Area/Club Facilities/Amenities Area are available for the benefit of the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s)/ owners /occupants of all the Apartments in "ANANDA THE DRIZZLE" and in the event of transfer of ownership of Schedule B(1) Property by the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) herein, such transferee will be automatically entitled to the benefits of the Club Area/Club Facilities/Amenities Area and its facilities and the transferor shall cease to be the member of the Club Area/Club Facilities/Amenities Block.</div>
<div class="cc">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">50</span><span class="c6i"></span>The Vendor/Promoter/Developer herein shall have absolute authority and discretion to provide licenses, contracts and permits to various agencies for establishment of various services and facilities etc. All the contracts to be entered by the Vendor/Promoter/Developer herein with various agencies for providing the above facilities and common area maintenance, security, and their tenure shall be binding on the Association to be formed among the owners of the Apartments/Flats to whom Vendor/Promoter/Developer herein will hand over the CLUB House and Its the facilities as well as administration of maintenance of common areas, amenities and facilities.</div>
<div class="cc">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">51</span><span class="c6i"></span>Upon termination of this Agreement, the Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s) shall not have any clalm/s over the Schedule-B(1) Property and/or on the Vendor/Promoter/Developer herein. The VENDOR herein shall be entitled to deal with Schedule -B(1) Property as it may deems fit for its benefit without any reference to Allottee(s)/Purchaser(s).</div>
<div class="cc">&#160;</div>
<div class="c45"><span class="c4">52</span><span class="c6i"></span><span class="c4">Stamp duty, Registration Charges and all other Incidental and Legal expenses:</span> All charges, expenses, stamp duty, registration fee and legal/incidental expenses etc., towards execution and registration of this Agreement and the sale deed, at the rate as may be applicable on the date of registration of this Agreement and the sale deed of the said Apartment including documentation shall be borne by the Purchaser/ Allottee only.</div>
